# Bank_conf represents the position of the bars
Bank_Configuration
1    0 0 0
2   0 2 3 0
3  0 1 0 2 0
4   0 2 3 0
5    0 0 0 

BarsTopPosition  275.0

Move_Banks  3  # n of moveable Bars defined
#
# Sequential three-phase transient with moderate reactivity insertions.
# Each bank moves over a partial stroke of 75 cm, one at a time.
#   Phase 1  [0, 2] s : bank 1 (left)      withdrawn  125 -> 200   (positive)
#   Phase 2  [2, 4] s : bank 3 (right)     inserted   275 -> 200   (negative)
#   Phase 3  [4, 6] s : bank 2 (symmetric) inserted   225 -> 150   (negative)
#
# bar_num   mat_bar   Points_defined    t_0  h_0     t_1  h_1     t_2  h_2     t_3  h_3
1             2         4               0.0  125     2.0  200     4.0  200     6.0  200
